                                                "sense_id": "48532f31-b2d7-36a4-b886-1a74fe3051e1",
                                                "text": "Nice tune. What's on the flipside?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8342a7c7-2902-3fec-9a12-c3b216bc11b0",
                                        "entry_id": "1fa9a468-72b7-3e71-9064-a2326e9a716b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A necessary consequence or corollary of something that acts as a negation or counterbalance; especially one seen as opposite, or as pro versus con."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d926662-7086-4cef-9cbb-4f22a79ac029",
                                                "sense_id": "8342a7c7-2902-3fec-9a12-c3b216bc11b0",
                                                "text": "Walking to work is definitely healthier – on the flipside, though, it takes twice as long."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d61d5eae-91f7-4604-bfdb-24f2b47469af",
                                                "sense_id": "8342a7c7-2902-3fec-9a12-c3b216bc11b0",
                                                "text": "Of course, the drop is partly the flipside of dollars being in demand. The pound does not benefit from safe-haven status like the Swiss franc or Japanese yen."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80db34a8-4084-3933-a0d5-f1d5f43d346a",
                                        "entry_id": "1fa9a468-72b7-3e71-9064-a2326e9a716b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The occasion when we meet again (e.g. when I return from work, etc.; said on parting); later or tomorrow."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5164e44-8485-4fa1-9961-ce4a62371411",
                                                "sense_id": "80db34a8-4084-3933-a0d5-f1d5f43d346a",
                                                "text": "See you on the flipside!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
